<title>USA: Banc One Q1 shr $0.86 vs $0.77.</title>
<headline>Banc One Q1 shr $0.86 vs $0.77.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.86		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net		 370,665		  345,881</p>
<p> Revs		2,709,584		2,487,557</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  426,146		  444,027</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Analysts consensus for quarterly earnings were $0.85, according to First Call.</p>
<p>The company said provisions for loan and lease losses were $235 million vs $162 million.</p>
<p>The company said total assets were $101.6 billion vs $95.7 billion.</p>
<p>The company said total deposits were $72.2 billion vs $70.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said total loans and leases, net of unearned, was $74 billion vs $69.2 billion.</p>
